  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Supporting stability in Libya, and mitigating the effects of contagion from the Sahel</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The project&#xbf;s &lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;overall objective&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is to support stability in Libya by mitigating the effects of contagion from the Sahel crisis on Libya, advancing the Libyan political process, and supporting international mediators. It will work on these interconnected tracks in a holistic manner, coordinating with the UN, EU and relevant neighbouring or concerned states.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Oc 1 &#xbf; Both national and local Libyan stakeholders have increased capacity to mitigate the effects of cross-border crises on Libya;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Oc 2 &#xbf; Libyan conflict actors engage in dialogue processes aimed at long-term stability at the national level and adopt more consensual positions, contributing to violence prevention and reduction;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Oc 3 &#xbf; The UN and other international mediators have access to a broader array of Libyan stakeholders, including hard-to-reach actors, and the capacity to bring them together in inclusive dialogue processes&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
